#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:104 b2ec3353632940a2bd88db04a57b8910
msgid ""
"Your uploaded imagery usually has no acquisition metadata (date, cloud "
"cover, off-nadir angle, resolution). Such cells are shown as \"**-**\" in "
"the table, and the **Clouds** / **Off-Nadir** / **AOI/Scene intersection** "
"filters do not hide your own imagery even if you tighten them."
msgstr ""
"Las imágenes cargadas generalmente no tienen metadatos de adquisición "
